{
  "format": "fnv.script.actions/1",
  "title": "Headless intro chain: VCG00 -> VCG01 -> VCG02 / VCG03 (docs/spec-notes/scripts.md section 9)",
  "actions": [
    {"op": "note", "text": "The player wakes in Doc Mitchell's house (the engine places the player; the marker is the one VCG01's commented-out start code names)."},
    {"op": "move_player", "to": "VCG01PlayerStartMarkerREF"},
    {"op": "note", "text": "New Game starts VCG00 (GECK wiki SetStage notes); its MenuMode block sets stage 0 while the main menu is open."},
